        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we completed our investments in Project Matterhorn, a global program designed to accelerate the growth of our business (\"Project Matterhorn\"), which we announced in September 2022.",
        "start_character": 4471,
        "end_character": 4660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through a combination of shredding facilities and mobile shredding units consisting of custom built trucks, we are able to offer secure shredding services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 7719,
        "end_character": 7891
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Today, we are a global leader in information management services, and we are trusted by more than 240,000 customers in 61 countries, including approximately 95% of the Fortune 1000, to help unlock value and intelligence from their assets through services that transcend the physical and digital worlds.",
        "start_character": 199,
        "end_character": 501
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to making a meaningful impact on our customers, our people and our business by cultivating a culture that is firmly grounded in our values: Acting with Integrity, Owning Safety and Security, Building Customer Value, Taking Ownership and Promoting Inclusion and Teamwork.",
        "start_character": 17657,
        "end_character": 17944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face competition from numerous storage and information management services providers globally, as well as storage and information management services that are managed and operated internally by organizations.",
        "start_character": 14824,
        "end_character": 15035
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a synergistic business model, where we leverage cross-selling opportunities against our end-to-end solutions across our 240,000 customers.",
        "start_character": 11531,
        "end_character": 11680
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We are a leading global provider of physical records management services and will seek to enhance our position in higher-growth markets such as Central and Eastern Europe, Latin America, Asia, the Middle East and Africa.",
        "start_character": 2309,
        "end_character": 2530
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We are focused on driving volume growth, while also capitalizing on revenue management opportunities as we enhance the value we are providing customers through our expanded suite of global and integrated services.",
        "start_character": 2094,
        "end_character": 2308
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We provide our digital solutions offering globally to customers across an array of market verticals.",
        "start_character": 3116,
        "end_character": 3217
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 488 MW of leasable capacity with an additional 852 MW under construction or held for development.",
        "start_character": 13245,
        "end_character": 13374
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of this, we invested to accelerate growth and to capture a greater share of the large, global addressable markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 4948,
        "end_character": 5090
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001020569-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001020569-26-000013-5551b54c8272d4fe",
        "accession_number": "0001020569-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also compete with numerous data center developers, owners and operators, many of whom own properties comparable to ours in several of the same metropolitan areas where our facilities are located.",
        "start_character": 15410,
        "end_character": 15608
      }
